  "solution": {
    "text": "When a capillary tube is broken at a height 5 cm, meaning that water will rise to height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>cm</mi><mo>,</mo></math> hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>cm</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Since, we know, for capillarity phenomenon <math><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> where symbols have their usual meaning.<br /><br />or <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></math> constant<br /><br />Thus, <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> [for glass <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ]<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
